---
component: bondStory
# A bond story: the hero's Bond tab, Story button, once per account, gated
# by the roster's bond-rank rule table. Each rank waits on the one before
# (prev, a canonical beat id; empty for r1). The story's own body plays at
# ::body, then the seal: the vow in the hero's voice and the rank reward.
params:
  who: speaker
  rank: { type: { entity: rank } }
  prev: { type: string, default: "" }
  vow: string
beat:
  on: bondStory
  target: "hero.@who"
  once: user
  after: "@prev"
  when: "holds('bondRank', [@who, @rank])"
---

## Bond story

::body
@@who: {{@vow}}
::bondReward{hero=@who rank=@rank}
@narrator: The crest on {{@who}}'s card glows a little brighter. Bond rank: {{@rank}}.
